---
title: Scan Job Error Path
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant API as /recognition/analyze
    participant Session as AsyncSession
    participant BG as BackgroundTasks worker
    participant ScanSvc as IdentityScanService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Logger as Logging

    API->>Session: create IdentityScanJob(status=pending)
    API->>BG: add_task(_process_scan_chunk,...)
    BG->>Session: set_tenant_context()
    BG->>ScanSvc: scan_identities(job, media_items)
    alt model/persistence error
        ScanSvc-->>Logger: exception
        ScanSvc->>DB: rollback()
        ScanSvc->>DB: job.status="failed"; error_message; completed_at
        DB-->>BG: commit failure status
    else success
        ScanSvc->>DB: job.status="completed"; counters updated
    end
    API-->>Client: jobs recorded; poll /recognition/jobs/{id}
